<title>USA: Casino Data Systems CEO resigns.</title>
<headline>Casino Data Systems CEO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Casino Data Systems Tuesday announced the resignation of Dan Copp as chief executive officer and a member of the board of directors.</p>
<p>&quot;Dan has elected to pursue other business opportunities,&quot; Steven Weiss, chairman, said in a statement. &quot;We thank him for his contribution to our company and wish him well in his future endeavors. The board will initiate a national search for a new CEO immediately.&quot;</p>
<p>Copp joined the board in June 1996, and was appointed chief executive officer in January this year.</p>
